From ddff273875a5ea423a1e874b95ae2d7e9b7aec57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincenzo Maisto <vincenzo.maisto2@unina.it>
Date: Fri, 10 Oct 2025 17:13:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/48] [hw/xilinx] WiP integration of CVA6+Ara custom IP in
 rv_socket

---
 config/README.md                |   2 +-
 config/scripts/configuration.py |   2 +-
 hw/xilinx/rtl/rv_socket.sv      | 136 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 hw/xilinx/rtl/uninasoc_pkg.sv   |   3 +-
